纯文本中的代码段落无需手动输入繁琐的反引号，系统能够自动推断语法结构：

function calculateReadingTime(text) {
  const wordsPerMinute = 300;
  const wordCount = text.trim().length;
  return Math.ceil(wordCount / wordsPerMinute);
}

